sequenceDiagram
 participant R as Ruta /api/cron/recurring
 participant B as CronJob
 participant I as IterativeCronJob
 participant J as RecurringRulesJob
 R->>J: new RecurringRulesJob().run(request)
 J->>B: run(request) heredado
 B->>B: verifyCronBearer y<br/>createServiceClientSync()
 alt Bearer inválido
  B-->>R: 401
 else Autorizado
  B->>I: execute(supabase)
  I->>J: fetchItems(supabase)
  J-->>I: Reglas activas
  loop Cada regla
   I->>J: shouldProcess(rule)
   opt Corresponde hoy
    I->>J: processItem(supabase, rule)
    J-->>I: Resultado / error del ítem
   end
  end
  I-->>B: Contadores processed / errors
  opt Hubo errores
   B->>B: alertAdmin(...)
  end
  B-->>R: JSON success / 500
 end
